          "minimum": 13,
          "multiclass": true,
          "text": "To qualify for a new class, you must have a score of at least 13 in the primary ability of the new class and your current classes (SRD 5.2.1 pp. 24-25); the Monk’s primary abilities are Dexterity and Wisdom. As a multiclass character you gain only the Hit Point Die trait from the Core Monk Traits table (SRD 5.2.1 p. 49): no saving throw, skill, weapon or armor proficiency."
